  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Republic of Palau Partnership for Economic Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support economic growth with a focus on tourism, tax reform and gender. To support economic aspirations and mitigate future external shocks, by diversifying Palau&#x2019;s tourism revenue through support to Palau Visitors Authority to grow tourism numbers and increase the connections between Australia and Palau. Support to the Bureau of Revenue and Taxation, through the Australian Taxation Office (ATO), aims to build a strong and effective working relationship between the ATO and Bureau of Revenue and Taxation (BRT) and support BRT in its work to implement a strong, transparent and effective tax compliance regime in the Republic of Palau. Implementation of the Australia &#x2013; Palau country plan for Gender Equality, to address gender-based violence, and encourage economic and leadership opportunities for all in Palau.</narrative>
  </description>
